<h1 style="text-align: start; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; font-size: 26px; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="start">Columbus Multi-Family Recycling Pilot</h1>
<p class="gd_p" style="text-align: start; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="start">A pilot program offering recycling collection service at eligible City of Columbus apartment and condominium complexes has launched and is seeking more participants.</p>
<p class="gd_p" style="text-align: start; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="start">This onsite service is being provided at no cost to help meet your residents’ desire to recycle and reduce reliance on the landfill. The pilot is set to run through 2022 and is a partnership of the City of Columbus and Solid Waste Authority of Central Ohio (SWACO).</p>
<p class="gd_p" style="text-align: start; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="start">It will provide valuable data collection to help the City and SWACO consider future planning for recycling collection service at multi-family complexes in our community.</p>
<p class="gd_p" style="text-align: start; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="start">Interested in learning more? Please email the pilot Program Manager at <a href="mailto:mike@goodlandohio.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">mike@goodlandohio.com</a>.</p>
